-- the sum of the fields of count messages, each bound discharged by the certificate at its offset
-- (the hypothesis for k is the recursion of times on (suc k)·16, definitionally plus 16 (k·16));
-- the bound for the rest is the same certificate's hypothesis weakened: k·16 ≤ n from 16 + k·16 ≤ n
weaken-m : (o n : Nat) → le (plus 16 o) n → le o n
weaken-m o n h = (plus (fst h) 16 , transN (plus-assoc (fst h) 16 o) (snd h))
